Node_GetTokenConfig
├── when token has no configuration
│   └── it should return default empty config
├── when token is configured
│   ├── it should return the correct actionType
│   ├── it should return the correct actionModule
│   ├── it should return the correct enabled status
│   ├── it should return the correct minBalance
│   └── it should return the correct moduleParams
└── when token configuration was cleared
    └── it should return default empty config again
